WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.720
A generated test earns promotion
through several checks.

00:00:02.846 --> 00:00:05.280
Review its code and intent first.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.400
Use identical fixtures
to show that the correct build

00:00:08.503 --> 00:00:11.760
passes and the duplicate-posting
variant fails.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:13.760
Retain the manifest,

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:18.000
raw evidence and cleanup results so
another engineer can repeat the run.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:22.320
The quality owner approves the proposed
change through the existing

00:00:22.378 --> 00:00:26.000
repository controls.
Compilation and a single passing run

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:29.680
are intermediate results,
not sufficient evidence for promotion.
